silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_04_manifest_hom_profiles_sections_02_manifest_field_arrows_concrete_anchor_5#mittensbodymasslocalinfo silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensBodyMassLocalInfo is In section 'Manifest Field Arrows' the bare symbol VetCarePlan anchors to MittensBodyMassLocalInfo: The interpreted claim extracted from the vet record: 'Mittens has a body mass of 4.2 kg recorded by Dr. Osei on 2024-03-15.' This is the paraphrase stripped of formatting artifacts; it states the Forge-relevant fact." .
